        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9f3a3f28-beea-4466-8990-a06fa14fa489\",\"review_text\":\"Really good and professional, but personalized to you\"},{\"review_id\":\"75be14a6-4d4c-4230-8938-53a8cc25853f\",\"review_text\":\"Am a premium user and currently skip add to queue ain't working, even contacting Spotify is not possible and not able to say this problem,@spotify care to weigh in.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a1242b9f-086b-4d13-98f0-111f80d69449\",\"review_text\":\"I use joox\"},{\"review_id\":\"0195d699-61d1-4fbb-a51b-508fc00c04db\",\"review_text\":\"The upgraded version is so bad that one can't even repeat a song or play it from where they want! How greedy this people are.... they want us to pay FOR basic functionality of a music app. I am extremely disappointed and disgusted right now never ever using this AGAIN. Make the app just as before or else just see your users go down faster than Apple dropping from a tree. It was my comfort app but now I just purely hate it. I WILL NOT TAKE PREMIUM DO WHATEVER YOU WANT!!! It's a less than 1!\"},{\"review_id\":\"3d62fa37-a7f0-4ebf-973d-9ec31f867f3a\",\"review_text\":\"Laanat Is app pr\"},{\"review_id\":\"35601fd2-07ac-4077-b228-fe479c560a1a\",\"review_text\":\"If I ever update this app again in this life make I bend\"},{\"review_id\":\"fba84c11-f57a-4bd1-8abd-55130338342a\",\"review_text\":\"Shitt aa thu , mar Jana saale kutte mera kaddu na de Paisa tujhe bheekmange\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca84a708-5d73-4a2b-8463-a5d4469a9c0e\",\"review_text\":\"The update SUCKS!!! Almost everything requires premium membership. Now I can't even listen to a song I want. I really used to love this app so much but I think it's time to delete it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f59293eb-67bc-4f24-80b2-5227d6f2f306\",\"review_text\":\"Damn so good app this is\"},{\"review_id\":\"947ddbb7-2d7c-4e85-a784-3ba654f498ad\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely amazing especially listening to sleeping pill podcast every night before i go to sleep at night is a free therapy and its so relaxing 😊😊❤️\"}]}"
